{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉穎鏇（Tiffany）近日在社交平台上載了一輯清新甜美的寫真，瞬間俘虜大批網民及粉絲的心！相中的 Tiffany 身穿純白小背心，隨性地在長椅上留下倩影，宛如化身成唯美的「森系女神」。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Tiffany 在帖文中寫道：「享受大自然」！照片中的她以一頭微曲長髮及精緻淡妝示人，對著鏡頭展露標誌性的甜美笑容，一舉一動都直擊網民心房，散發出極致的青春氣息與自然美態。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c920ce7a-3a3b-44cf-a132-264cdd7ac204.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Xgjw828m5i1790303036.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c920ce7a-3a3b-44cf-a132-264cdd7ac204.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ca23d97a-0620-416a-8a37-62d303dedb1c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Yir2TByU1M1790303035.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ca23d97a-0620-416a-8a37-62d303dedb1c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這輯靚相曝光後，大批粉絲紛紛湧入留言區，洗版式大讚女神勁 Pure：「什麼角度都是美」、「青春少女」、「永遠最美的笑容」，足見其極高的人氣與魅力！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T02:59:03.367613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}